Subject: [PATCH] Remove an empty unlinked core integration-test placeholder

The upstream file contains only a module comment and has no tests or module registration. Delete it so the existing dependency-usage check passes without exempting unlinked source files.

With cargo-shear 1.11.2, the maintained check-cargo-shear command fails with shear/unlinked_files before deletion and exits 0 with zero warnings afterward.
---
 codex-rs/core/tests/suite/scenarios_read_only_mcp.rs | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)
 delete mode 100644 codex-rs/core/tests/suite/scenarios_read_only_mcp.rs

diff --git a/codex-rs/core/tests/suite/scenarios_read_only_mcp.rs b/codex-rs/core/tests/suite/scenarios_read_only_mcp.rs
deleted file mode 100644
index 2cad1c930..000000000
--- a/codex-rs/core/tests/suite/scenarios_read_only_mcp.rs
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1 +0,0 @@
-//! Thread policy reaches MCP discovery and execution without relying on model arguments.
-- 
